                       Thief Powers
---------------------------------------------------------------------

Use 'tpowers' for the live, rank-sorted command list. Use
'tpowers available' to show only abilities your current unlock level
can use.

The modern core kit is:

  case, quickstrike, dirtyfight, trip, sidestep, circle, envenomstrike,
  disembowel, hamstring, backstab

World and escape play includes:

  scout, detect, reveal, hide, slip, vanish, shadow, palm, pilfer, pick,
  plant, breakin, tripwire, disarm, trap, disguise, covertracks,
  forge, frame, and fasttalk

Poisoncraft includes:

  poisons, extract, prepare, envenom/poison, and lace/dose

Progression and customization:

  tstatus, knacks, and method

Clever Strike, Sucker Punch, Trick, Shadowstep, and Critical Hit are
compatibility command names redirected into the smaller core combat
kit. The old leadership-only combat powers are retired; Don, Guild
Master, and Quarter Master records remain administrative.

The listing is driven by this supported command registry. Dead repair and
emote debris is not exposed as guild kit merely because a file exists.
